### Check run for one lead thickness of a lead x energy scan: the EXPACS muon spectrum itself over
### the band range of the scan (leadSpectrumMin - leadSpectrumMax, GeV), same plane and selection.
### Its rates should equal the sums over the mono-energetic points. Needs leadT and the aliases of
### the scan definition; expects the geometry and source settings of lead_energy_scan_t.mac.

/control/add leadSpectrumSeed {leadSpectrumSeed0} {leadT}
/gun/seed {leadSpectrumSeed}
/tof/cosmic/monoEnergy 0 GeV
/tof/cosmic/energyMin {leadSpectrumMin} GeV
/tof/cosmic/energyMax {leadSpectrumMax} GeV
/OutputFile leadspec_t{leadT}
/run/beamOn {leadSpectrumEvents}
